cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this analysis code, please cite the paper below and this dataset."
type: dataset
title: "6DoF Rendering Comparison: Data and Analysis Code"
abstract: >-
  Raw per-trial localization and quality-rating data from a listening experiment
  comparing five rendering approaches (one 3DoF baseline and four 6DoF methods)
  for navigable playback of a multi-point higher-order Ambisonics orchestral scene
  in virtual reality, with the R Markdown analysis that generates every statistic,
  figure and LaTeX value reported in the accompanying paper. 36 listeners were
  tested at two sites; 35 are analyzed for localization and 34 for ratings.
